# The example Dockerfiles build from the monorepo root, so everything not
# needed to install and build lands here. `node_modules` on its own would only
# match the root one — the `**/` form covers the per-package ones too.
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
.git
.github

# Build output and test artifacts are regenerated inside the image.
**/dist
**/.bunny
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local tooling / editor state
.claude
.ai-pod
.playwright-cli
**/.DS_Store
